<title>BELGIUM: EU probes Thomson recapitalisation - source.</title>
<headline>EU probes Thomson recapitalisation - source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission agreed on Wednesday to start a formal probe into a French proposal to recapitalise Thomson SA consumer electronics unit, a European Commission source said.</p>
<p>No other details were available. A formal statement was expected later.</p>
</text>
